  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F.",
    "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper and arrange Madeleine molds on top.",
    "Melt butter in a small saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add garlic and sauté for 1-2 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add white wine and simmer for 2-3 minutes until reduced by half.",
    "Stir in parsley, dill, lemon zest, salt, and pepper.",
    "Arrange prawns on top of Madeleine molds and spoon the herb mixture over them.",
    "Bake for 8-10 minutes until prawns are pink and just cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, prepare the nimono broth by combining vegetable broth and honey in a saucepan.",
    "Bring the broth to a simmer over medium heat.",
    "To assemble the dish, place a Madeleine bite on each plate and spoon the hot nimono broth over it."
